  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "12afbeeb-056c-5c83-a78a-b4a2240e86e1",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 4 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -5 & -5 & -5 & -6 \\\\ 3 & -6 & -4 & -9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -5 & -7 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 6 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $A,B,$ and $C?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $A$ is a $3\\times 4$ matrix, $B$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix, and $C$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix.\n\nThere are $3$ columns in $C$ and $3$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $C$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $C$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{C}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{A}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $B$ and $3$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $B$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $B$ and $A$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{B}_{2\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{A}_{3\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $A$ and $2$ rows in $C.$ Since the number of columns in $A$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $C,$ the matrices $A$ and $C$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{3\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{C}_{2\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nThe product $CA$ is well defined. The products $BA$ and $AC$ are undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "33165bab-0692-5da3-8ab0-4ec369e9839f",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $CA$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "a38ac6d4-317f-5451-9330-d2802e0b08e5",
