  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "e40b341a-46a1-5136-a6ab-9737bf9c5b36",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -6 & -2 & -5 \\\\ 6 & 0 & -1 & 8 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -7 & 9 \\\\ 6 & -5 & -5 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -3 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 8 & -2 & -7 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 \\\\ 8 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $D,E,$ and $F?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $D$ is a $4\\times 4$ matrix, $E$ is a $3\\times 4$ matrix, and $F$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere are $4$ columns in $E$ and $4$ rows in $D.$ Since the number of columns in $E$ equals the number of rows in $D,$ the matrices $E$ and $D$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{E}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{D}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $F$ and $3$ rows in $E.$ Since the number of columns in $F$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $E,$ the matrices $F$ and $E$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{F}_{2\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{E}_{3\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $D$ and $3$ rows in $E.$ Since the number of columns in $D$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $E,$ the matrices $D$ and $E$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{D}_{4\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{E}_{3\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nThe product $ED$ is well defined. The products $FE$ and $DE$ are undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3609c053-49db-5e29-a5c1-4205ff539638",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $ED$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "c0a46882-669c-5f93-b192-39a91e51da42",
