  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "39d16907-231b-583f-bd06-9de2903f1d63",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 6 \\\\ 5 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -8 \\\\ 4 & 3 \\\\ 5 & -9 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$T=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 9 & 2 & -7 \\\\ -5 & -6 & -7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $R,S,$ and $T?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $R$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix, $S$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix, and $T$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix.\n\nThere are $2$ columns in $R$ and $2$ rows in $T.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $T,$ the matrices $R$ and $T$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{T}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $S$ and $2$ rows in $T.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ equals the number of rows in $T,$ the matrices $S$ and $T$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{T}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $T$ and $4$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $T$ equals the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $T$ and $R$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{T}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{R}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $RT$ and $ST$ and $TR$ are well defined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "ef88b5dd-83bb-54c8-96a4-63bf25d54516",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $RT$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "73139d6d-9700-54ca-b3fa-0820a6eb5ef0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
