  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "263f7617-7381-53f0-b881-31509fc3d51e",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -2 & 7 \\\\ -7 & -6 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -9 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $A,B,$ and $C?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $A$ is a $4\\times 1$ column vector, $B$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix, and $C$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix\n\nThere is $1$ column in $A$ and $2$ rows in $B.$ Since the number of columns in $A$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $B,$ the matrices $A$ and $B$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{4\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{B}_{2\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $C$ and $4$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $C$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $C$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{C}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{A}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 1}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $A$ and $2$ rows in $C.$ Since the number of columns in $A$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $C,$ the matrices $A$ and $C$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{4\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{C}_{2\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nThe product $CA$ is well defined. The products $AB$ and $AC$ are undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "5319bf83-4e39-5afb-81fd-75da0bc606db",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $AB$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "3db8b28f-afac-5b52-ad8d-6684a3790a4f",
