  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "62ba679f-c6b1-5e35-8f43-eccbc3fadcea",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -4 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -6 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 6 \\\\ -7 & -9 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & -9 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 2 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 9 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$T=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 \\\\ -7 & -8 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $R,S,$ and $T?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $R$ is a $4\\times 3$ matrix, $S$ is a $3\\times 4$ matrix, and $T$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere are $3$ columns in $R$ and $3$ rows in $T.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $T,$ the matrices $R$ and $T$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{T}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $T$ and $4$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $T$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $T$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{T}_{3\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{4\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $3$ columns in $R$ and $3$ rows in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{S}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $RT$ and $RS$ are well defined. The product $TR$ is undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "e722ac22-dd28-527e-8c78-20ada084231f",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $RT$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "bd5a28ae-236e-5ac2-bf6a-31f7501b7548",
